kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861250/extras/2422eb489784bf8b711a82ab5d9163ba.poster.avif?t=1751016252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861250/extras/2422eb489784bf8b711a82ab5d9163ba.webm?t=1751016252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861250/extras/2422eb489784bf8b711a82ab5d9163ba.mp4?t=1751016252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861250/extras/513461f28800977f966acdb5834d42a6.poster.avif?t=1751016252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861250/extras/513461f28800977f966acdb5834d42a6.webm?t=1751016252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861250/extras/513461f28800977f966acdb5834d42a6.mp4?t=1751016252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control over Nittch, a nihilist and lonely delivery guy that survives in the lowest level of ANTRO. Your mission is to deliver a package to an unknown recipient. That\u2019s how your long journey through the corners of the city begins, catching the attention of La C\u00fapula and joining the rebellion of Los Discordantes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You better be ready to prevent this unusual world from subduing you. Because the key to revolutionize ANTRO is literally on your shoulders.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861250/extras/e2dac3f3e064017b333950d96db149ad.poster.avif?t=1751016252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.ak